      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.21,
      "end_seconds": 9.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.61,
      "end_seconds": 15.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Um, so... some bleeding. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.18,
      "end_seconds": 19.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.97,
      "end_seconds": 25.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Since Monday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.86,
      "end_seconds": 47.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Any passing tissue, fainting or shoulder tip pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.13,
      "end_seconds": 53.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "No, no passing tissue, fainting or shoulder tip pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.22,
      "end_seconds": 57.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.77,
      "end_seconds": 59.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.87,
      "end_seconds": 64.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.54,
      "end_seconds": 67.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.88,
      "end_seconds": 86.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.54,
      "end_seconds": 91.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.8,
      "end_seconds": 113.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.47,
      "end_seconds": 117.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.92,
      "end_seconds": 120.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.12,
      "end_seconds": 124.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.03,
      "end_seconds": 128.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.79,
      "end_seconds": 135.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.17,
      "end_seconds": 138.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.45,
      "end_seconds": 143.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.48,
      "end_seconds": 148.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.53,
      "end_seconds": 153.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Yes, grass pollen, it gives me sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.68,
      "end_seconds": 161.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.28,
      "end_seconds": 170.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.92,
      "end_seconds": 197.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 122 over 68, pulse 65. And SpO2 99 percent on room air, temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.76,
      "end_seconds": 204.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.04,
      "end_seconds": 208.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.58,
      "end_seconds": 223.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low down and your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.42,
      "end_seconds": 229.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Alright, all finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.93,
      "end_seconds": 252.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, my working impression is bleeding in early pregnancy that needs a scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.07,
      "end_seconds": 260.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Mm, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.48,
      "end_seconds": 277.78,
      "duration_seconds": 16.3,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now bleeding in early pregnancy that needs a scan is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'd like to arrange an early pregnancy scan for bleeding in early pregnancy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 279.13,
      "end_seconds": 282.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.0,
      "end_seconds": 300.5,
      "duration_seconds": 16.5,
      "text": "I'll request a pregnancy hormone level, it'll help with bleeding in early pregnancy. Use pads rather than tampons and avoid intercourse until the scan. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.92,
      "end_seconds": 316.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.3,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. I'd like you to see the early pregnancy unit as well, and I'll write the referral. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the bleeding becomes heavy or the pain becomes severe or one-sided."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.13,
      "end_seconds": 319.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.44,
      "end_seconds": 326.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.53,
      "end_seconds": 330.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
